<para>Executes the behaivour of the enemy. The enemy will move towards the player until the player is in sight. Once in sight of the player, reveal the tank Then, after 1.5 seconds, stop moving and start shooting for 2 seconds After shooting, fallback to a random location. This lasts for 5 seconds or until the enemy reaches the target location Repeat. </para>
</listitem>
